{"id":"665880","name":"家炖大踏板鱼","author":"五加五左左","authorId":"11514294","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/665880/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"大踏板鱼","amount":"1条"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"1段"},{"name":"姜","amount":"1块"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"2瓣"},{"name":"干辣椒","amount":"2颗"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"2颗"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"踏板鱼处理干净。","img":"images/665880/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"太大了，锅炖不下，把鱼对半切开。","img":"images/665880/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"葱切段，姜蒜切片。","img":"images/665880/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"热锅热油，将葱姜蒜干辣椒炒香。","img":"images/665880/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入大酱，炒香。","img":"images/665880/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入开水，调味。","img":"images/665880/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"把鱼放进炖汁当中。","img":"images/665880/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"小火炖半个小时。","img":"images/665880/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"小火炖，关注汁的量，大火收汁。","img":"images/665880/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"出锅，撒一点香菜。","img":"images/665880/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}